  "job_B9.6.5_20251003_115055": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00f0e Sigeberht \u00fea gyta rice h\u00e6fde, cwom of Hibernia Scotta ealonde halig wer sum, \u00fe\u00e6s Se w\u00e6s in wordum & d\u00e6dum beorht & scinende, swelce he w\u00e6s in \u00e6\u00f0elum m\u00e6genum m\u00e6re Wilnade he, \u00fe\u00e6tte he swa hw\u00e6r swa he gelimplice stowe findan meahte, \u00fe\u00e6t he wolde for Godes \u00dea cwom he in Eastengla m\u00e6g\u00f0e, & he w\u00e6s from \u00fe\u00e6m foresprecenan cyninge arwyr\u00f0lice Ond sona fylgde \u00fe\u00e6s weorc, \u00fe\u00e6t him gewunelic w\u00e6s, \u00fe\u00e6t he godspellice lare l\u00e6rde; & monige he \u00dea w\u00e6s he \u00fe\u00e6r mid sume untrymnesse his lichoman \u00feread, in \u00fe\u00e6re he geearnade \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6s In \u00fe\u00e6re he w\u00e6s monad, \u00fe\u00e6t he geornlice \u00e6tfele \u00fe\u00e6re ongunnan \u00feegnunge \u00fe\u00e6s godcundan \u00dea w\u00e6s se Godes monn mid \u00fea gesih\u00f0e swi\u00f0e getrymed: ongon \u00fea hr\u00e6dlice timbran \u00fea stowe W\u00e6s f\u00e6ger mynster getimbred in wuda neah s\u00e6 in sumre ceastre, seo is nemned on Englisc \u00dea burg eft \u00e6fter \u00feon Anna \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6g\u00f0e cyning & monige \u00e6\u00f0ele menn mid hearum getimbrum W\u00e6s \u00fees wer Furseus of \u00fe\u00e6m \u00e6\u00feelestan cynne Scotta; ac feor micele \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6s on his moode & \u00fe\u00e6tte swi\u00feost halgum gedafena\u00f0, eall \u00fea \u00f0e he geleornade to donne, he bighygdelice teolode \u00dea w\u00e6s for\u00f0gongendre tide, \u00fe\u00e6t he him syndrig wiic getimbr",
